[%# The command that checks that the signing key signed the database.  The
    fragment runs it once in the build, and the unit of synapse runs it before
    every start.  Both include this file, so they cannot disagree about the
    database or the old keys.  See matrix_check_signing_key.  The last
    directive eats the newline, so that the includer goes on the same line. -%]
/usr/local/sbin/matrix_check_signing_key [% install_dir %]/matrix.[% domain %]/homeserver.db '[% server_name %]' /etc/matrix-synapse/homeserver.signing.key[% FOR id IN old_signing_keys.keys().sort() %] '[% id %]'[% END -%]
